<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95565" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοβ-ᾰρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοβέω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rushing, violent</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεμος . . φέρεται ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				406
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. κατέχει αὔρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pax</u>
					944
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ς. εἰσελήλυθεν ὁ συκοφάντης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					872
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ς. ἡμῖν ἀρτίως καὶ πολεμικός . .
					κλάει κατακλινείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Pk.</u>
					52
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίαν ἦν θρασὺς καὶ ς. [ὁ
			Ἔρως</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Aristopho
				11.5
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρῶς</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥσυχος, ἠρέμα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				83
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>swaggering, pompous, haughty</i>: of a horse,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαῦρος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				10.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. καὶ ὀλίγωρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					59.37
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. αὐχένες, ὀφρύες</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.27
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				91
			</span></i> (both <i><span class="en">
				Rufin.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοβαρὸς τῇ χαίτῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Zeux.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοβαρὸν γελᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					4.1
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				20.15
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.72.13
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>proud</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοι ἀδεεῖς καὶ
			ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				18
			</span></i>; <i>fearless</i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Sent.Vat.</u>
				45
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. μέλος</span> a <i>rousing</i>
			tune, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				674
			</span></i>; <i>imposing</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολή</span>]
				<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				45
			</span></i>; of a triumphal procession, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				34
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοβαρωτέρα τιμῇ</span> at a
				<i>more impressive</i> price, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				16.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἀναθήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					67
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρῶς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				70
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
